                "text": "As negotiations for the Farm Bill continue, and as a member of @SenateAgDems, I\u2019m fighting to include expansive nutrition legislation.\n\nMy 6 bills are dedicated to increasing nutrition access, protecting local grocers, and closing loopholes.",
